=== an INSERT ... SELECT handler may mix read-only and body-carrying methods ===
['GET','PUT','DELETE']
=== but it still needs at least one mutating method ===
BAD_ARGUMENTS
=== a lengthless bodyless PUT to an INSERT ... SELECT handler works ===
200
=== a lengthless bodyless DELETE to an INSERT ... SELECT handler works ===
200
=== both requests inserted their row ===
2	3	3
=== an INSERT ... SELECT ... FROM input(...) handler does read the body: read-only methods are rejected ===
BAD_ARGUMENTS
=== and a lengthless request to it is answered with 411 ===
1
=== while a request with a length inserts the body ===
4	3	200
